  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme for Country Partnership for China (2026-2030)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN"># The Programme for Country Partnership (PCP) for China (2026#2030) provides an integrated framework through which the United Nations Industrial Development Organization (UNIDO) and its partners support the Government of China in achieving inclusive and sustainable industrial development (ISID). It has been formulated in the conjunction with China#s 15th Five-Year Plan period, the country#s ongoing industrial transformation, the United Nations Sustainable Development Cooperation Framework (UNSDCF) and it builds upon the results and the lessons from previous UNIDO#China cooperation frameworks and translate the strategic priorities of China#s 15th Five-Year Plan into a coherent programme designed to deliver measurable result at a scale.</narrative>
  </description>
